---------------------------- (refl-qtm-var) // definition depends on the identity: ⟦𝔄[⇑]⟧ ≐ ⟦𝔄⟧[↑]
Γ·⟦Φ⟧ ⊦ ⟦⬡ᵢ⟧ : ⟦Φ‖ᵢ⟧

