----------------------------------------- (refl-qtm-var-suc)
Γ·⟦Φ⟧ ▷ ⟦𝔄⟧ ⊦ ⟦⬡ᵢ₊₁⟧ ≐ ⟦⬡ᵢ⟧[↑] : ⟦Φ‖ᵢ⟧[↑]

// corollary
Γ ⊦ Φ qctx
------------------------- (refl-qtm-var-index)
