Γ ; 𝒮 ⊦ 𝕥 : El 𝕦      Γ ; 𝒮 ⊦ ī : 𝔗[𝕚𝕕, 𝕥]
------------------------------------------ (isp-ind)
Γ ; 𝒮 ⊦ 𝕥, ī : El 𝕦 ◁ 𝔗

// A sort at its indices: application to an index spine, iterated.

Γ ; 𝒮 ⊦ 𝕥 : 𝔗 ⇛ U      Γ ; 𝒮 ⊦ ī : 𝔗
