------------------------------------------ (refl-arity-pi-ext)
Γ · ⟦𝒮⟧ ⊦ ⟦A ⇛ 𝔄⟧ᵗ ≐ A[↑⟦𝒮⟧] ◁ ⟦𝔄⟧ᵗ[ξ] tel

Γ ; 𝒮 ▷ El 𝕥 ⊦ 𝔄 qty
-------------------------------------------- (refl-arity-pi-ind)
